Name: zstd
URL: https://github.com/facebook/zstd
Version: 1.5.7
License: BSD-3-Clause
License File: LICENSE

The library sources from the v1.5.7 release tarball (lib/zstd.h,
lib/zstd_errors.h, lib/common, lib/compress and lib/decompress), unmodified.
lib/decompress/huf_decompress_amd64.S is left out; build/gen.py builds with
ZSTD_DISABLE_ASM instead.
